-- src:370 | Power B may be exercised in place of, or as well as, power A.
-- src:371 | Information supplied or made available under power B complies with legislation that refers to, requires, or otherwise operates with the form as if the information had been supplied or made available in an approved or a prescribed form (and the legislation applies, with all necessary modifications, accordingly).
